# www serves the identical site instead of redirecting — a second indexable
# copy of every page. Canonical tags already point to the apex, but a 301 is
# the stronger signal and avoids relying on crawlers honouring canonical.
https://www.verifiednepal.com/* https://verifiednepal.com/:splat 301
